+## Attendee message
+
+Subject: Your Harvest Commons Volunteer Thank-You Day details
+
+We look forward to welcoming you to Harvest Commons Volunteer Thank-You Day on Saturday, 2026-10-17, from 09:00–14:30 America/Chicago at Juniper House. Check-in opens at 09:00 in the Welcome Hall, and coffee, tea, and oat milk will be available. Please bring a reusable water bottle.
+
+Our workshop is Neighborhood Printmaking Lab in Studio B. Aprons are provided; bring one simple black-and-white image idea. At lunch, the Garden Table Buffet will be vegetarian, with clearly labeled servings and reserved meals for 6 vegan and 4 gluten-free guests.
+
+Juniper House has a step-free main entrance, an all-gender accessible restroom, and a quiet room beside the Garden Room. Route 6 stops at River Street one block from the venue, and bike racks are at the main entrance.
+
+## Coordinator checklist
+
+- [ ] Open two staffed check-in lanes by 08:50.
+- [ ] Place ink trays and drying racks at all 12 tables.
+- [ ] Set out 6 vegan and 4 gluten-free reserved meal cards.
+- [ ] Post step-free entrance signs and reserve quiet seating.
+- [ ] Set the gratitude-card basket at each table and open the north exit at 14:30.
